Problem:
A waste treatment company must remove waste using a large container or a medium container. A large container can take 5 tons of waste while a medium container can take 3.5 tons of waste. The treatment plant has available at most 40 large containers and 35 medium containers. Additionally, due to logistics in the storage warehouse, there must be at most 65 total containers and they must use at least 6 medium containers. Finally, there must be twice as many medium containers than large containers. How many of each container should they use to maximize the total amount of waste they can transport?

